!logs/bug_counter.json
!logs/project-state.md
!logs/protocol_violations.md
!logs/queued_for_review_*.md
# Whitelisted for autonomous pipeline (CCR drafts → OCI DS/GAI → session approval):
!logs/pending_ds_gai_*.json
!logs/pending_patch_*.patch
!logs/pending_approvals_*.md
# Whitelisted for research memos (quarterly holds, session analysis):
!logs/quarterly_holds_research_*.md
# Whitelisted for failure log (approach history across sessions):
!logs/ERRORS.md
# Whitelisted for MTF FULL BOT AUDIT — JUNE 26 (standing multi-session audit initiative):
!logs/mtf_full_bot_audit/
!logs/mtf_full_bot_audit/*
# Whitelisted for interactive→API build-package scope docs and session decision queues:
!logs/api_build_packages_*.md
!logs/pending_claude_session_*.md

